{"1980540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Department / Trosedd", "steam_appid": 1980540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Department</strong> is a <strong>story‑driven detective game</strong>, you step into the role of a newly assigned Detective Sergeant working cases in a gritty modern-day Welsh city in the midst of a dark conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/f40a9d85bbce91dba757cbe4b044b38c.poster.avif?t=1774871819\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/f40a9d85bbce91dba757cbe4b044b38c.webm?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/f40a9d85bbce91dba757cbe4b044b38c.mp4?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case is a <strong>fully playable investigation</strong> built around evidence, interviews, timelines, and deduction. Explore crime scenes, analyse clues, question suspects, and uncover contradictions as you build your case from the ground up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/07935eadc99c89b2e063e7568eff1b3c.poster.avif?t=1774871819\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/07935eadc99c89b2e063e7568eff1b3c.webm?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/07935eadc99c89b2e063e7568eff1b3c.mp4?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the tools of the trade; <strong>forensics, </strong>dynamic<strong> interrogations </strong>and a customisable<strong> case board</strong> to organise your findings, connect evidence, and develop your own theories. The Department is designed to engage you in authentic detective work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/b4b36f755f7776c2b0a58a235673c379.poster.avif?t=1774871819\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/b4b36f755f7776c2b0a58a235673c379.webm?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/b4b36f755f7776c2b0a58a235673c379.mp4?t=1774871819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your investigation deepens, the choices you make will shape the cases outcome, and the fate of the city itself. But be warned, in this city, some secrets are best left buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See you on the job, Detective.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Department</strong> is a <strong>story‑driven detective game</strong>, you step into the role of a newly assigned Detective Sergeant working cases in a gritty modern-day Welsh city in the midst of a dark conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980540/extras/f40a9d85bbce91dba757cbe4b044b